  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Light sphere, Telekinesis sphere.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> By amplifying and focusing the tiny pressure exerted by light with your powers of telekinesis, you can move a target with the force of light alone. When you cause a target to glow, you may increase the casting time by one step to also lift it with your telekinesis as part of the same action. If using Area Glow, you can lift multiple objects if you also possess Divided Mind. You may concentrate to maintain the bright light of this glow and your telekinesis with a single action.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/light#toc72\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
